OL,10,G0350 Witness History
OL,11,     FIn 1999, the pill was legalised in
OL,12,     FJapan after decades of
OL,13,     Fcampaigning. Politician Yoriko
OL,14,     FMadoka pushed hard for the right
OL,15,     Fto take the oral contraception.
